  "slug": "nonconformance-inspection-checklist-form",
  "title": "Nonconformance Inspection Checklist Form",
  "subtitle": "Route the nonconforming product or process control, verify readiness, record requirement-level results, contain exceptions, authorize status, and preserve accountable closeout.",
  "description": "An operational nonconformance inspection checklist form for controlling a suspect product, material, or process output from assignment through evidence-based inspection, exception containment, disposition, handoff, and final verification.",
  "use_case": "Use when a nonconformance coordinator must inspect a suspect product, material, or process output against the specific requirement, objective evidence, and nonconformance procedure and provide a traceable basis to contain, disposition, verify, and close the nonconformance without losing traceability.",
  "risk_tier": "A",
